<title>USA: Concord Energy gets $4.3 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Concord Energy gets $4.3 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>JORDANTOWN, Texas 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Concord Energy Inc said Thursday it closed on a $4.3 million contract to engineer and refurbish a gas processing plant in Arkansas.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal call for an initial payment of 30 percent of the contract value, with the balance being received during the course of the installation, Concord said.</p>
<p>The installation should be completed within this quarter.</p>
<p>Concord Energy is an oil and gas service company.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
